{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43416","headline":"宴李家宅 · 无名氏","name":"宴李家宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画屏深掩瑞云光，罗绮花飞白玉堂。\n银榼酒倾鱼尾倒，金鑪灰满鸭心香。\n轻摇绿水青蛾歛，乱触红丝皓腕狂。\n今日恩荣许同听，不辞沈醉一千觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}